      "created": 1794842407589,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TableFormat\n- utility class (spawn one instance when\nyou need it, destroyed at end of scope)\n\n1. openTable(\"fileName\") ->\nshared_ptr<const TableReader>\n2. writeTable(\"fileName\",\ntinykv::Iterator& entries) ->\nshared_ptr<const TableReader>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "2kwftQghSxU_dHNSOsq4z",
      "originalText": "TableFormat\n- utility class (spawn one instance when you need it, destroyed at end of scope)\n\n1. openTable(\"fileName\") -> shared_ptr<const TableReader>\n2. writeTable(\"fileName\", tinykv::Iterator& entries) -> shared_ptr<const TableReader>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
